er; background:var(--tint)\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 22h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4\"></path></svg>\n      </span>\n      <h3 style=\"margin:0; font:600 16px/1.3 inherit; letter-spacing:-0.01em\">Galeria Visual</h3>\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.65; color:var(--text-3); text-wrap:pretty\">Navegue, pesquise e gerencie com filtros.</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; background:var(--surface); padding:22px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:11px\">\n      <span style=\"width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid var(--accent); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background:var(--tint)\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4M7 10l5 5 5-5M12 15V3\"></path></svg>\n      </span>\n      <h3 style=\"margin:0; font:600 16px/1.3 inherit; letter-spacing:-0.01em\">Exportação em lote</h3>\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.65; color:var(--text-3); text-wrap:pretty\">Baixe arquivos ou exporte como ZIP.</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; background:var(--surface); padding:22px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:11px\">\n      <span style=\"width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid var(--accent); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background:var(--tint)\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10\"></path></svg>\n      </span>\n      <h3 style=\"margin:0; font:600 16px/1.3 inherit; letter-spacing:-0.01em\">100% Privado</h3>\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.65; color:var(--text-3); text-wrap:pretty\">Zero rastreamento.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border); padding-block:120px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:26px\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; max-width:600px\">\n      <span style=\"font:500 11.5px/1 ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--accent-text)\">Como funciona</span>\n      <h2 style=\"margin:0; font-size:32px; font-weight:600; line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:-0.02em\">Três passos para garantir seu trabalho</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap:14px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; padding:20px; border:1px solid var(--border-2); border-radius:8px; background:var(--bg-alt)\">\n        <span style=\"width:26px; height:26px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid var(--accent); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font:600 12px/1 ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace; color:var(--accent-text)\">1</span>\n        <span style=\"font:600 14.5px/1.35 inherit\">Instalar</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:var(--text-3)\">Adicione o Abrium ao Chrome.</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; padding:20px; border:1px solid var(--border-2); border-radius:8px; background:var(--bg-alt)\">\n        <span style=\"width:26px; height:26px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid var(--accent); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font:600 12px/1 ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace; color:var(--accent-text)\">2</span>\n        <span style=\"font:600 14.5px/1.35 inherit\">Conversar</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:var(--text-3)\">Use o Claude normalmente.</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; padding:20px; border:1px solid var(--border-2); border-radius:8px; background:var(--bg-alt)\">\n        <span style=\"width:26px; height:26px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid var(--accent); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font:600 12px/1 ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace; color:var(--accent-text)\">3</span>\n        <span style=\"font:600 14.5px/1.35 inherit\">Salvar</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:var(--text-3)\">Os artefatos são capturados automaticamente.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; background:var(--bg-alt); padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:120px; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:14px; justify-content:space-between\">\n    <span style=\"font:500 13px/1.5 inherit; color:var(--text-2)\">Código aberto e privado</span>\n    <a href=\"/${lang}/download\" style=\"height:40px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding:0 16px; border-radius:7px; border:1px solid var(--accent); color:var(--accent-text); font:600 13px/1 inherit; cursor:pointer; text-decoration:none\">\n      Obter para Chrome\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m9 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"}};
